      ],
      "solution": "Shortcut: For successive changes of a% and b%, net change = a + b + ab/100. Here, 20 + (-20) + (20 * -20)/100 = -4% (decrease). Full: Assume original price = 100. After 20% increase = 120. After 20% decrease = 120 * 0.80 = 96. Net change = (96-100)/100 * 100 = -4%.",
