      ],
      "solution": "Shortcut: η = 1 - 1/r^(γ-1) = 1 - 1/8^0.4. Since 8^0.4 = 2^1.2 ≈ 2.3, η ≈ 1 - 0.435 = 0.565 (56.5%). Full Solution: Thermal efficiency of Otto cycle η = 1 - 1/r^(γ-1). Substituting r=8, γ=1.4: η = 1 - 1/8^0.4 = 1 - 1/2.2974 = 1 - 0.4353 = 0.5647 ≈ 56.5%.",
